  "title": "Alien Dictionary",
  "difficulty": "hard",
  "summary": "Infer the alien letter order from sorted words by comparing adjacent words, then topologically sort.",
  "problem": "Given a list of words sorted in an alien alphabet, infer the order of its letters. Compare each pair of adjacent words; the first position where they differ gives one order edge. Build a directed graph from those edges and return a topological sort.",
  "example": {
    "input": "[\"wrt\",\"wrf\",\"er\",\"ett\",\"rftt\"]",
    "output": "\"wertf\""
  },
